# Cut from Wave VII, Intro Focus 25 (CD2-3). The tape crosses Focus 24 as the
# first stage of its movement from 23 to 25: a point of light approached until
# the count of twenty-four. This file stops at that authored intermediate rung.

@segment    climb-f23-f24
@title      Climb — Focus 23 to Focus 24
@levels     F24
@from       F23
@fixed
@verbosity  3
@protected  Focus 24
@duration   ~1m

say As you move, remain fully conscious and under complete control.
pause 4
say Before you is a tiny pinpoint of light. Look for it.
pause 5
say When you perceive it, focus your attention on that speck of light.
pause 5
say With your attention on the speck of light, move in the direction of that light.
pause 6
level F24
say Twenty-four.
pause 5
say Focus 24.
pause 3
say The light is getting larger and larger. It is very bright, but you get used to it because it is familiar to you.
pause 8
